WEBVTT

00:05:28.475 --> 00:05:30.543
Sometimes that's because it's hard to tell

00:05:30.543 --> 00:05:32.864
a concussion has occurred 
in the first place.

00:05:32.864 --> 00:05:37.214
But it's also often due to pressure
or a desire to keep going

00:05:37.214 --> 00:05:40.136
despite the fact that something's wrong.

00:05:40.136 --> 00:05:42.185
This doesn't just undermine recovery.

00:05:42.185 --> 00:05:44.494
It's also dangerous.

00:05:44.494 --> 00:05:46.714
Our brains aren't invincible.

00:05:46.714 --> 00:05:49.414
They still need us to shield 
them from harm

00:05:49.414 --> 00:05:52.202
and help them undo damage
once it's been done.